        )}

        <p className="event-confirmation__message">
          {registration?.status === "CONFIRMED"
            ? "You are confirmed for this event."
            : "Your registration may require approval. You will be notified when your status changes."}
        </p>

        <Link to="/events" className="events-button">
          Explore more events
        </Link>
      </div>
    </main>
  );
}

```

The confirmation route should not depend exclusively on browser navigation state. A production implementation must retrieve confirmation details through a secure endpoint using a registration-specific token, and must not expose participants' data by predictable IDs.

